rom her town Kurouzu-cho, where the residents get obsessed with spirals due to an unexplained curse.","popularity":7.7626,"poster_path":"/wtQIgqEQEIQnNqLVGTShUf7qLap.jpg","first_air_date":"2024-09-29","softcore":false,"name":"Uzumaki","vote_average":6.967,"vote_count":198},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hikJz6TqmnS2czz18QZKVgWmKs2.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,35,10765,10768],"id":93256,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"慎重勇者～この勇者が俺TUEEEくせに慎重すぎる～","overview":"Goddess Ristarte summons Seiya Ryuuguuin, an OVERLY cautious hero to save the world of Gaeabrande. Seiya is obsessed with muscle training and buying extra armor to deal with low level creatures. It’s simply one cautious mission at-a-time for this hero!","popularity":16.056,"poster_path":"/bbg1FMU7c3W06KUKrgIhIECFliZ.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-10-02","softcore":false,"name":"Cautious Hero: The Hero Is Overpowered but Overly Cautious","vote_average":8.1,"vote_count":310},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8fPGleo9X3jsToxOFp8L82FwqrX.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10765],"id":151,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ボスコアドベンチャー","overview":"The Fountain of Life is the source of all life forces in the Bosco World. Princess Apricot, who is supposed to become Queen of Fountainland-the Guardian of the Fountain of Life-is kidnapped by villains who aim to rule the Bosco World.\n\nIf Princess Apricot can't take the queen's throne by the next solar eclipse, the Fountain of Life will dry up. The animals living in the forest of Bosco, including Frog, Otter and Tortoise, decide to help Princess and take her to Fountainland in order to protect their peaceful life in the Bosco World. So begins the journey in a balloon full of dreams, hope, adventures, and love!","popularity":9.5279,"poster_path":"/vwsLECVfkosaPvICQWwwxpT8g9y.jpg","first_air_date":"1986-10-06","softcore":false,"name":"Bosco Adventure","vote_average":3,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8f1GotliT9KBPEb